add('A11',r'''Consider sequences of parameters $(N,n,d)$ that diverge proportionally to each other''',[10],'Section 4 — sequence convention (excerpt)','The exact source sentence is recorded below; N and n are indexed by d, rather than limits over unrelated independent dimensions.')
